        "node_id": "n_10_f8467e",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2: Ensure that the query list has exactly four elements for \"1\" queries and three elements for \"2\" queries before attempting to access their indices. This will prevent `IndexError` exceptions. Adjust the code to check the length of the query list before processing it.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-3186588169656932409",
