        "node_id": "n_12_e4e205",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2: To efficiently handle the queries, we can use prefix sums to avoid recalculating the entire range for each \"2\" query after every \"1\" query. This allows us to update the boxes in constant time and query the sum in logarithmic time using binary indexed trees (BITs).",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-3186588169656932409",
